cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Sipat, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sipat: offline typhoon companion for Filipino households"
abstract: >-
  Sipat is an offline-first typhoon companion for Filipino households on budget
  Android phones. It turns the PAGASA warning a family heard into a checklist
  fitted to the household and answers Taglish questions only from official
  preparedness guides bundled in the app (PAGASA, NDRRMC and OCD, DOH,
  PHIVOLCS, BFP), with optional on-device Llama 3.2 1B rephrasing.
authors:
